  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc44:2.2.4": "The Pali reads <i lang='pi' translate='no'>tiracchānagatāya vā manussaviggahitthiyā vā</i>, but it is not clear what <i lang='pi' translate='no'>manussaviggahitthiyā</i> would refer to in this context, and so I take this to be an editing mistake. I here follow the PTS reading, <i lang='pi' translate='no'>tiracchānagatamanussaviggahitthiyā vā</i>, which makes better sense and is consistent with the following rule. ",
